{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審，蔡天鳳前夫鄺港智作供時提及，2015年8月，因為涉及罪行，要坐「大飛」前往內地，其後用相同方法，往返內地和香港，每次都是包船，費用是10萬元，自己有能力支付。</p><p></p><p>鄺港智稱，在內地期間有同蔡天鳳維持聯絡，每天都有傾談幾個小時電話或視頻。代表律師問鄺港智，是否覺得自己和蔡天鳳仍然是夫婦，鄺港智回答稱「複雜，難以解釋」，又稱兩人最終離婚，「唔記得邊年」，由蔡天鳳處理，「自己無簽」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI.PM 1500_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FpsRToHtvc1795075751.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>鄺港智之後又提到，11歲時已經認識譚方駿，知道蔡天鳳會與對方結婚，鄺港智稱知道後有少少不開心，但都有祝福兩人，指蔡天鳳曾經向自己提過，是因為錢而同譚方駿結婚。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI.PM 1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Vvd5WirDud1795075736.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>鄺港智又在庭上指，譚方駿鍾意自己，但譚方駿家人想要小朋友，所以三個人就一齊，譚方駿的家人不介意。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.CHOI.PM 1500.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fjBqUZyafo1795075480.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:54:31.467328+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:26:39.834658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T08:47:52.714057+00:00","content_hash":"771812d7d6174858474586ff11bad2b285dcdc9bc3cab6aef23497d984a0b1d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T08:54:31.467328+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}